<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - SigmaTron restarted as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - SigmaTron restarted as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--National Securities Corp said Friday it reinstated coverage of SigmaTron International Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>--Its earnings EPS estimates are $1.08 for FY97 and $1.38 for FY98.</p>
<p>--National Securities' price target on SigmaTron, a contract manufacturer of electronic components and printed circuit board assemblies, is $20.</p>
<p>--SigmaTron was trading at 11-3/4, up 3/4.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
